id=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jqBqj15W4x0Q7kNvwG0Y8O4&_nc_oc=AdqEwEihIElhoGdZM0bNQv89D-0H1A3nxRTko20n5ttp7PFEu5ePXm14UNOBWHiz9cc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9GBwD7V8xpB8LO2RSocR6dHZXtKDh9D4EwnxpJtKu_lA&oe=6A467C89"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "2236750433728309", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820001_2236750437061642_7202580099581255007_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=atiRo9O9EO8Q7kNvwF7KmOs&_nc_oc=AdpYmcHc3tk4WMfQBQpFnSLmqa_H2eDBqFkmQaQVdodJ2z6vxLoCq-qnv10_ov6L-xg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_TPGiaZ_7AHRMU9mn2ElCfyIjQg6xAnP_-sTJVS_p5SQ&oe=6A466240"}, "display_name": "Neon Pool", "keywords": ["Neon", "Pool", "Billiards", "eightball", "Elegant"], "long_description": "Neon Pool is an 8-ball Billiards game played on a billiard table with six pockets, cue sticks, and sixteen billiard balls (a cue ball and fifteen object balls). The object balls include seven solid-colored balls numbered 1 through 7, seven striped balls numbered 9 through 15, and the black 8 ball. After the balls are scattered with a break shot, a player is assigned either the group of solid or striped balls once they have legally pocketed a ball from that group. The object of the game is to legally pocket the 8-ball in a \"called\" pocket, which can only be done after all of the balls from a player's assigned group have been cleared from the table.\n\nThe game contains 4 levels of difficulty: Easy, Medium, Hard and Master, it can be played on Single Player as well as on Multiplayer mode.", "short_description": "Neon Pool is an 8-ball Billiards game with an elegant neon environment setup."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-notice-last-updated-april-06.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": n